153	 * Leaf blocks only (the `hasNot` filter drops enclosing section cards,
154	 * which would also satisfy `has:` through their children) and exact label
155	 * matching, so strict mode stays armed: two questions sharing a label fail
156	 * loudly instead of silently resolving to whichever renders last. Assert
